---

The DDC/CI protocol implementation in `macos/src/DDCNative.swift` follows the
approach documented in https://github.com/didriksg/Crisp (didriksg/Crisp),
in particular its field notes on Dell monitor behavior
(docs/ddc-notes.md). No code was copied verbatim; the implementation was
written independently against the DDC/CI specification and verified against
the S3423DWC.

VCP feature codes used here are defined by the VESA Monitor Control
Management Interface (VCP) standard. The S3423DWC-specific PBP mode values in
`shared/monitor-profile.json` were measured empirically on that monitor.
